  (text "Instagrid ONE max is the only AC source.\nQ1 does not switch PE. QF1 is type B, 30 mA.\nBoth 0 V rails meet at X1:4. W1 is the only bond to PE.\nConfirm that bond in the S200 PTI manual.\nSDR-120-24 feeds only S200 X124. The brake driver is inside the drive.\nThere is no 48 V rail. VC-PW-5200 and VC-PW-5400 are obsolete." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 10.16 12.70 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ff658209-4a4d-5c15-8f69-24cdfb5057ed"))
